    "DescriptionEn": "<p><b>AlfaNet </b>consists of a subscription-based fast internet connection that can be used at your home or office, at a discounted price. This service is available through a dedicated data SIM locked to an electricity powered, 32 users, 4G+ routers.</p>\r\n",
